### Classroom Asset Tracker — HTTP Requests
### Compatible with IntelliJ HTTP Client, VS Code REST Client extension
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

# ============================================================
# DASHBOARD
# ============================================================

### Get dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/

# ============================================================
# ASSETS
# ============================================================

### List all assets
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets

### List assets filtered by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets?type=CLASSROOM_PC

### Search assets by name or building
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets?search=Science

### Filter and search combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets?type=PROJECTOR&search=Hall

### View asset detail (replace 1 with a real asset ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets/1

### New asset form
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets/new

### Edit asset form (replace 1 with a real asset ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/assets/1/edit

### Save new asset (POST form submission)
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets/save
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Test+Projector&assetType=PROJECTOR&serialNumber=SN-TEST-001&building=Test+Hall&roomNumber=Room+999&purchaseDate=2022-01-01&warrantyExpiryDate=2027-01-01&notes=Test+asset

### Delete asset (replace 1 with a real asset ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets/1/delete

# ============================================================
# MAINTENANCE
# ============================================================

### List all maintenance events
GET {{baseUrl}}/maintenance

### Filter — upcoming (next 30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/maintenance?filter=upcoming

### Filter — overdue
GET {{baseUrl}}/maintenance?filter=overdue

### New maintenance event form
GET {{baseUrl}}/maintenance/new

### New maintenance event pre-filled for a specific asset (replace 1 with asset ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/maintenance/new?assetId=1

### Edit maintenance event form (replace 1 with event ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/maintenance/1/edit

### Save new maintenance event
POST {{baseUrl}}/maintenance/save
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

assetId=1&status=SCHEDULED&scheduledDate=2026-09-01&completedDate=&description=Annual+hardware+inspection

### Mark maintenance event as complete (replace 1 with event ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/maintenance/1/complete

### Delete maintenance event (replace 1 with event ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/maintenance/1/delete

# ============================================================
# REPLACEMENT RECOMMENDATIONS
# ============================================================

### List all replacement recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations

# ============================================================
# H2 DATABASE CONSOLE (default profile only)
# ============================================================

### Open H2 console (use in browser — not an API endpoint)
### URL:      http://localhost:8080/h2-console
### JDBC URL: jdbc:h2:mem:assetdb
### Username: sa
### Password: (leave blank)
